      "text": "Repository development practice: the project is maintained by Databricks for Field Engineers; external contributions are not currently accepted, though issues may be opened. Contributors follow PEP 8, add type hints, and run ruff (pinned 0.11.0, line-length 120, py311) before submitting PRs."
