          "git_sha": "8b6e4054e28bd19ad300575712a1b84ddd6e2e8b",
          "line_end": 347,
          "line_start": 342,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "databricks-solutions/ai-dev-kit",
          "url": "https://github.com/databricks-solutions/ai-dev-kit/blob/b059fd017a2c5743c31a0ff30dc8a618723aae4f/README.md#L342-L347"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_047b48c3dcf1c1234e8599cf204bce35123e7894e05e0517d8b6040611da205e"
      ],
      "text": "By default `databricks aitools install` installs the official databricks plugin through each agent's own plugin CLI for Claude Code, Codex, and Copilot, and writes raw skill files for Cursor, OpenCode, and Antigravity; --skills-only forces raw files everywhere."
    },
