        "slc_01fa96aacb71be1ffc4802203593eb5ea67a13ceb93544ad877922d91d4b161e",
        "slc_e9585e246872831d0adce498e5eb3c418f28a060311a07a2e994e8f7e93a2c2e"
      ],
      "text": "The installer supports --list-skills and --dry-run to preview skills, profiles, resolved refs, and the aitools command without changing anything, plus environment variables MLFLOW_REF, INCLUDE_PRERELEASES, and DRY_RUN."
