  "summary": "The kit ships as four composable pieces: skills, a full-stack Builder App, a Python library (databricks-tools-core), and a standalone MCP server exposing 40+ Databricks tools. The databricks-tools-core Python library exposes functions such as execute_sql for direct use in Python projects, and is described as compatible with LangChain and the OpenAI Agents SDK. Evidence coverage: 162 of 175 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
